# W165 (2026-11-23): plain (no ASan) real libgphoto2 2.5.34 build, default
# distro stack protector. Build: copy the lab-patched source tree to
# src/libgphoto2-2.5.34-plain, `make clean`, configure with
# CFLAGS='-O0 -g -fPIC -fno-omit-frame-pointer' (no -fsanitize), same
# --with-camlibs=jl2005c --enable-vusb options, prefix installdir-plain,
# `make -j4 && make install`. Driver: gcc -O0 -g -fno-omit-frame-pointer
# live/real_init.c -o live/real_init_plain $(pkg-config --cflags --libs
# libgphoto2 from installdir-plain) -lltdl.
#
# Run env: CAMLIBS/IOLIBS from installdir-plain, IOLIBS_PREFIX=vusb,
# LD_LIBRARY_PATH=installdir-plain/lib, M2SHELL_JL2005_VUSB=1,
# M2SHELL_JL2005_COUNT=<n>, port usb:001,001. Count 100 and 1022 runs:

