# Result: device-chosen 0x5a bytes overwrite both the stack canary and the
# saved RIP of the real jl2005c_init frame. The stack protector calls
# __stack_chk_fail before ret, so no chosen control-flow target is executed.
# Grade unchanged: rung 4 chosen bytes at a real control-flow slot, not IP
# control; no witness retry, no rung 5. Synthetic vusb transport only.
